WEBVTT

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:21.170
Ahiru no Sora

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:25.330
Nanairo no niji ga umareta asa 
The morning yields a rainbow of seven colors

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.880
Tori tachi wa hane o hirogete yuku
The birds all spread their wings wide

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.500
Kotae nante doko ni mo nai kara sa
There are no answers to be found anywhere

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.250
Sore o egaki ni yukou
So let's go and create them

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.040
Feel it

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.460
Feel it

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.670
Utsukushiki hane o motsu kimi wa
You have beautiful wings of your own

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:50.460
Taiyou o mezashi tobu no darou
And you will use them to fly up to the sun

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:53.960
Matataki no sono shunkan ni sekai o
For that one sparkling moment

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:58.250
Kaeru koto mo dekiru to shinjite
Believe that you can change even the world itself

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:05.210
Bokura wa toumei na kokoro de umareta hazu sa
We were surely born with transparent hearts

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:09.880
Yogoreta kutsu de habatakunda
Using our dirty shoes we will take flight

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.250
Arch o egaku youni
Drawing an arch in the air

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:19.630
Ashita no sora ga kieteshimau sono mae ni
Before the sky of tomorrow disappears completely

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:26.580
Kanashimi no yoru o koete umarekawarunda
Pass through a night of sorrow and be reborn

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:35.630
Break

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:51.960
Kuzuryu

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:51.960
Yokohama Taiei

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.710
Egaita yume tsukamu no wa
I know that realizing dreams

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:27.460
Kantan janaitte wakatteru kedo
Is not an easy thing to accomplish, but

00:22:27.670 --> 00:22:32.670
Saisho kara muri datte dakyou shiteru
Those who say it's impossible from the beginning

00:22:32.670 --> 00:22:37.960
Hito no me hikari wa mienai
Can't see light with their eyes

00:22:38.080 --> 00:22:43.500
Miageru sora no kousei tachi wa
Up above in the sky are the fixed stars

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:48.710
Itsumo inochi o moyashite hikatteru
That always shine bright with life

00:22:48.790 --> 00:22:50.830
Boku ni datte
I can, too

00:22:51.210 --> 00:22:55.130
Taiyou runner kokoro o kanzen nenshou
Taiyou runner with a heart burning at maximum

00:22:55.130 --> 00:23:01.290
Goal e kakumei no hikari hanatsu yo
Radiating the light of revolution towards the goal

00:23:01.460 --> 00:23:07.420
Last rei byou sore made kekka nante wakaranai sa
Nobody can know the outcome until the very last second

00:23:07.710 --> 00:23:14.080
Akireru hodo onore o koete hashiritsuzukeru yo
I'll keep on running and improving until I don't recognize myself

00:23:14.170 --> 00:23:16.750
Step 1! Shouri o mark shite
Step 1! Focus on winning

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:19.380
Step 2! Image wakasete
Step 2! Imagine the future

00:23:19.380 --> 00:23:24.830
Step 3! Tada zenryoku de penerate
Step 3! Just penetrate through at full power

00:23:31.040 --> 00:23:35.420
Ahiru no Sora

00:23:31.040 --> 00:23:35.420
Next Time: Certain Proof
